[{:db/id 17592186184197 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-afa39ae4-c580-535b-a23d-346f2dd8aacb"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-afa39ae4-c580-535b-a23d-346f2dd8aacb" :question/id #uuid "afa39ae4-c580-535b-a23d-346f2dd8aacb" :question/math-academy-id "q-139495" :question/problem "Which of the following statements are true?\n\nI. Any $4\\times 2$ matrix $A$ has at most $2$ distinct singular values.\n\nII. Any matrix of the form  $A=[\\begin{aligned}-a & 0 \\\\ 0 & a\\end{aligned}]$ has exactly one negative and one positive singular value.\n\nIII. Any $2\\times 4$ matrix $A$ has at most $4$ distinct singular values." :question/worked-solution "The singular values of the matrix $A$ are the square roots of the eigenvalues of the matrix ${A}^{T}\\,A.$ \n\nWith that in mind, let's examine our statements.\n\n- Statement I is true. Since $A$ is a $4\\times 2$ matrix and ${A}^{T}$ is a $2\\times 4$ matrix, ${A}^{T}\\,A$ must be a $2\\times 2$ matrix: \n\n$$\n{{A}^{T}}_{2\\times 4}\\times {A}_{4\\times 2}={{A}^{T}\\,A}_{2\\times 2}\n$$\n\nHence, $A$ has at most $2$ distinct singular values.\n\n- Statement II is false.  All singular values of any matrix are non-negative. So, \n$A$  can't have any negative singular value.\n\n- Statement III is true.  Indeed,  since $A$ is a $2\\times 4$ matrix and ${A}^{T}$ is a $4\\times 2$ matrix, ${A}^{T}\\,A$ must be a $4\\times 4$ matrix: \n\n$$\n{{A}^{T}}_{4\\times 2}\\times {A}_{2\\times 4}={{A}^{T}\\,A}_{4\\times 4}\n$$\n\nHence, $A$ has at most $4$ distinct singular values.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-b4af41fc-239f-5a7e-a80b-a2420f5b8338"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-b4af41fc-239f-5a7e-a80b-a2420f5b8338" :answer-field/id #uuid "b4af41fc-239f-5a7e-a80b-a2420f5b8338" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-40fdca2f-83f4-5df1-91ac-71d9cae34022" :answer-field/choices ["answer-847726dd-ce3c-59a8-b0a3-56c25e5f0e39" "answer-40fdca2f-83f4-5df1-91ac-71d9cae34022" "answer-36eba7dc-6041-512a-861b-afc8fb49a806" "answer-a8ede84f-1362-5752-926a-19b15b77d6de" "answer-60f43eb3-cb35-56ea-ac3e-0a1959a7891c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-847726dd-ce3c-59a8-b0a3-56c25e5f0e39" :answer/id #uuid "847726dd-ce3c-59a8-b0a3-56c25e5f0e39" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-40fdca2f-83f4-5df1-91ac-71d9cae34022" :answer/id #uuid "40fdca2f-83f4-5df1-91ac-71d9cae34022" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-36eba7dc-6041-512a-861b-afc8fb49a806" :answer/id #uuid "36eba7dc-6041-512a-861b-afc8fb49a806" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I, II, and III" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a8ede84f-1362-5752-926a-19b15b77d6de" :answer/id #uuid "a8ede84f-1362-5752-926a-19b15b77d6de" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-60f43eb3-cb35-56ea-ac3e-0a1959a7891c" :answer/id #uuid "60f43eb3-cb35-56ea-ac3e-0a1959a7891c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186133920 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-573468a3-fb63-5275-a038-70008c621f95" "question-a33bcbcb-8c75-50ac-adb2-e56b319ae036"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-573468a3-fb63-5275-a038-70008c621f95" :question/id #uuid "573468a3-fb63-5275-a038-70008c621f95" :question/math-academy-id "q-52512" :question/problem "Given $h(x)=\\frac{\\sqrt{2x+7}}{\\sqrt{x-7}},$ find $h(10).$" :question/worked-solution "We replace $x$ with $10$ in the given expression, and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}h(10) & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2x+7}}{\\sqrt{x-7}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2(10)+7}}{\\sqrt{10-7}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{27}}{\\sqrt{3}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{\\frac{27}{3}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{9} \\\\  & =3\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-0e139fa0-76a4-5594-9a74-4a4f77cb4697"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-0e139fa0-76a4-5594-9a74-4a4f77cb4697" :answer-field/id #uuid "0e139fa0-76a4-5594-9a74-4a4f77cb4697" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-e32e104e-2aac-5934-b393-8c62f7b1409a" :answer-field/choices ["answer-e32e104e-2aac-5934-b393-8c62f7b1409a" "answer-2dab17f9-ac22-5b75-8783-b52b67743213" "answer-ae36fff1-0086-53b3-8ccf-68ca8561af6a" "answer-d8236676-eb79-576e-9082-b3357e3fa004" "answer-ca4f137d-8bf7-5971-bebc-50b3d830afe7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e32e104e-2aac-5934-b393-8c62f7b1409a" :answer/id #uuid "e32e104e-2aac-5934-b393-8c62f7b1409a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2dab17f9-ac22-5b75-8783-b52b67743213" :answer/id #uuid "2dab17f9-ac22-5b75-8783-b52b67743213" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\sqrt{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ae36fff1-0086-53b3-8ccf-68ca8561af6a" :answer/id #uuid "ae36fff1-0086-53b3-8ccf-68ca8561af6a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d8236676-eb79-576e-9082-b3357e3fa004" :answer/id #uuid "d8236676-eb79-576e-9082-b3357e3fa004" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ca4f137d-8bf7-5971-bebc-50b3d830afe7" :answer/id #uuid "ca4f137d-8bf7-5971-bebc-50b3d830afe7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186133921 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-7e27eddd-1b20-5f57-9534-d5e05a5f064b" "question-c6b5a56c-98c8-5d43-970c-b65710fedbd3"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-7e27eddd-1b20-5f57-9534-d5e05a5f064b" :question/id #uuid "7e27eddd-1b20-5f57-9534-d5e05a5f064b" :question/math-academy-id "q-63881" :question/problem "Evaluate $\\sqrt[3]{8a+1}$ at $a=10.$" :question/worked-solution "We replace $a$ with $10$ in the given expression, and simplify as much as possible:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt[3]{8a+1} & = \\\\ \\sqrt[3]{8\\cdot 10+1} & = \\\\ \\sqrt[3]{80+1} & = \\\\ \\sqrt[3]{81} & = \\\\ \\sqrt[3]{27\\cdot 3} & = \\\\ \\sqrt[3]{{3}^{3}\\cdot 3} & = \\\\ \\sqrt[3]{{3}^{3}}\\cdot \\sqrt[3]{3} & = \\\\ 3\\sqrt[3]{3} & \\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-cfbc7d7c-d17d-5047-bb6c-dea5dcb79c39"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-cfbc7d7c-d17d-5047-bb6c-dea5dcb79c39" :answer-field/id #uuid "cfbc7d7c-d17d-5047-bb6c-dea5dcb79c39" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-c453f044-0ddc-57f7-a430-a4b1237e6816" :answer-field/choices ["answer-44057f65-5e0b-5abb-9f88-1d6765f2c3cd" "answer-3308a8c5-80f5-511f-b76a-4421e28d64df" "answer-c453f044-0ddc-57f7-a430-a4b1237e6816" "answer-751bfe77-634f-5b8c-9e0e-ec26f932991e" "answer-cf142703-648a-59a8-9972-954f2b3fd31f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-44057f65-5e0b-5abb-9f88-1d6765f2c3cd" :answer/id #uuid "44057f65-5e0b-5abb-9f88-1d6765f2c3cd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\sqrt[3]{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3308a8c5-80f5-511f-b76a-4421e28d64df" :answer/id #uuid "3308a8c5-80f5-511f-b76a-4421e28d64df" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c453f044-0ddc-57f7-a430-a4b1237e6816" :answer/id #uuid "c453f044-0ddc-57f7-a430-a4b1237e6816" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\sqrt[3]{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-751bfe77-634f-5b8c-9e0e-ec26f932991e" :answer/id #uuid "751bfe77-634f-5b8c-9e0e-ec26f932991e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-cf142703-648a-59a8-9972-954f2b3fd31f" :answer/id #uuid "cf142703-648a-59a8-9972-954f2b3fd31f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt[3]{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186133919 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-bbba28e1-c797-5200-af1b-5dd4807a9f53"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-bbba28e1-c797-5200-af1b-5dd4807a9f53" :question/id #uuid "bbba28e1-c797-5200-af1b-5dd4807a9f53" :question/math-academy-id "q-82110" :question/problem "Evaluate $\\sqrt{x-3}$ for $x=15.$" :question/worked-solution "We replace $x$ with $15$ in the given expression, and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{x-3} & = \\\\ \\sqrt{15-3} & = \\\\ \\sqrt{12}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can simplify even further using the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{12} & = \\\\ \\sqrt{4\\cdot 3} & = \\\\ \\sqrt{{2}^{2}\\cdot 3} & = \\\\ \\sqrt{{2}^{2}}\\cdot \\sqrt{3} & = \\\\ 2\\sqrt{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-9748a26e-5f17-5d21-9edf-d14cdccf2bde"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-9748a26e-5f17-5d21-9edf-d14cdccf2bde" :answer-field/id #uuid "9748a26e-5f17-5d21-9edf-d14cdccf2bde" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-f01f2406-67a2-5187-84d4-8c436902d153" :answer-field/choices ["answer-f01f2406-67a2-5187-84d4-8c436902d153" "answer-f72c64eb-800b-5870-8d96-1200b7f9c0d6" "answer-4218e341-ec0e-58d8-ace2-9ffbfc437a65" "answer-990ec7ed-3f19-5a4a-ad58-9fa197948fcb" "answer-4f5cadc9-e3f7-5691-bddf-0c37a865c6eb"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f01f2406-67a2-5187-84d4-8c436902d153" :answer/id #uuid "f01f2406-67a2-5187-84d4-8c436902d153" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\sqrt{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f72c64eb-800b-5870-8d96-120