answer/value "∨" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-86cefea1-4583-5e59-84d3-54626f201af0" :question/id #uuid "86cefea1-4583-5e59-84d3-54626f201af0" :question/math-academy-id "q-177355" :question/problem "$2+3$ equals $5$ **or** $\\pi $ is rational.\n\nConsider the compound statement above and the following notations:\n\n- $A:2+3\\text{ equals }5$\n\n- $B:\\pi \\text{ is rational}$\n\nExpressed in symbolic form, our statement can be written as\n{{field-1}}{{field-2}}{{field-3}}." :question/worked-solution "The word \"or\" is represented by the symbol \"$∨$\".\n\nSo, the sentence reads\n\n$$\n{{2+3\\text{ equals }5}_{⏟}}_{A}\\,{{\\text{or}}_{⏟}}_{∨}\\,{{\\pi \\text{ is rational}}_{⏟}}_{B},\n$$\n\nthat is, $A∨B.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-853ca648-9285-5210-a9e2-7a773d61d909" "answer-field-9a73910a-95ea-55fe-9741-862df3b17506" "answer-field-c8ae1b07-0aba-5c33-b3be-6170360b0fa8"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-853ca648-9285-5210-a9e2-7a773d61d909" :answer-field/id #uuid "853ca648-9285-5210-a9e2-7a773d61d909" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-96b27b00-fad8-5342-a031-248b5d0c0f50" :answer-field/choices ["answer-96b27b00-fad8-5342-a031-248b5d0c0f50" "answer-da76c7cc-2d09-5707-86e8-427bb55b41a0" "answer-0f4eb50d-bdf1-56bd-ae21-6340ff65e425"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-96b27b00-fad8-5342-a031-248b5d0c0f50" :answer/id #uuid "96b27b00-fad8-5342-a031-248b5d0c0f50" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "A" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-da76c7cc-2d09-5707-86e8-427bb55b41a0" :answer/id #uuid "da76c7cc-2d09-5707-86e8-427bb55b41a0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "∧" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0f4eb50d-bdf1-56bd-ae21-6340ff65e425" :answer/id #uuid "0f4eb50d-bdf1-56bd-ae21-6340ff65e425" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "∨" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-9a73910a-95ea-55fe-9741-862df3b17506" :answer-field/id #uuid "9a73910a-95ea-55fe-9741-862df3b17506" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-0defd42e-78e1-5a8e-be99-039f2931f9a1" :answer-field/choices ["answer-75326658-ed74-568d-abf3-409566976d7f" "answer-d3b7d970-d7c7-56f7-bf59-d37c213cadec" "answer-3f3e2179-a22e-5c95-9546-e21187e53978" "answer-0defd42e-78e1-5a8e-be99-039f2931f9a1"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-75326658-ed74-568d-abf3-409566976d7f" :answer/id #uuid "75326658-ed74-568d-abf3-409566976d7f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "A" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d3b7d970-d7c7-56f7-bf59-d37c213cadec" :answer/id #uuid "d3b7d970-d7c7-56f7-bf59-d37c213cadec" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "B" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3f3e2179-a22e-5c95-9546-e21187e53978" :answer/id #uuid "3f3e2179-a22e-5c95-9546-e21187e53978" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "∧" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0defd42e-78e1-5a8e-be99-039f2931f9a1" :answer/id #uuid "0defd42e-78e1-5a8e-be99-039f2931f9a1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "∨" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-c8ae1b07-0aba-5c33-b3be-6170360b0fa8" :answer-field/id #uuid "c8ae1b07-0aba-5c33-b3be-6170360b0fa8" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-22666030-8f00-5aee-9b8d-82246f1b7de9" :answer-field/choices ["answer-d8c8cf17-f57a-5da7-bb5f-19cdf520914f" "answer-22666030-8f00-5aee-9b8d-82246f1b7de9" "answer-a148fd44-ea29-5211-a325-b1f910ce877b" "answer-3fa6d785-376b-5c6e-ba91-98b001836f33"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d8c8cf17-f57a-5da7-bb5f-19cdf520914f" :answer/id #uuid "d8c8cf17-f57a-5da7-bb5f-19cdf520914f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "A" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-22666030-8f00-5aee-9b8d-82246f1b7de9" :answer/id #uuid "22666030-8f00-5aee-9b8d-82246f1b7de9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "B" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a148fd44-ea29-5211-a325-b1f910ce877b" :answer/id #uuid "a148fd44-ea29-5211-a325-b1f910ce877b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "∧" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3fa6d785-376b-5c6e-ba91-98b001836f33" :answer/id #uuid "3fa6d785-376b-5c6e-ba91-98b001836f33" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "∨" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-20409d3d-4f9a-55b3-ae07-39d336721810" :question/id #uuid "20409d3d-4f9a-55b3-ae07-39d336721810" :question/math-academy-id "q-170736" :question/problem "Express the statement \"$8$ is a natural number and divisible by $4$\" in symbolic form, where $P=$ \"$8$ is a natural number\" and $Q=$ \"$8$ is divisible by $4.$\"" :question/worked-solution "The word \"and\" is represented by the symbol \"$∧.$\"\n\nNote that the given sentence is a shortened version of the following full sentence:\n\n$8$ is a natural number and $8$ is divisible by $4.$\n\nSo, the sentence reads\n\n$$\n{{8\\text{ is a natural number}}_{⏟}}_{P}\\,{{\\text{and}}_{⏟}}_{∧}\\,{{8\\text{ is divisible by }4}_{⏟}}_{Q},\n$$\n\nthat is, $P∧Q.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-fda58e98-bdbc-530e-bf08-2b35adcab71d"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-fda58e98-bdbc-530e-bf08-2b35adcab71d" :answer-field/id #uuid "fda58e98-bdbc-530e-bf08-2b35adcab71d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-c788bb6a-3103-557c-8827-e479bc17cfa2" :answer-field/choices ["answer-fd3b589e-c610-5002-a7df-286e992e76fd" "answer-edef6b4f-6fa8-5244-a412-5dda014bbd8b" "answer-c788bb6a-3103-557c-8827-e479bc17cfa2" "answer-ac8831f6-0b30-5fff-99a5-bdc86ee2c9df" "answer-d65dc866-fd3f-54f7-a7c4-b6f364caf884"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-fd3b589e-c610-5002-a7df-286e992e76fd" :answer/id #uuid "fd3b589e-c610-5002-a7df-286e992e76fd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "P∧(P∨Q)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-edef6b4f-6fa8-5244-a412-5dda014bbd8b" :answer/id #uuid "edef6b4f-6fa8-5244-a412-5dda014bbd8b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "P∧P" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c788bb6a-3103-557c-8827-e479bc17cfa2" :answer/id #uuid "c788bb6a-3103-557c-8827-e479bc17cfa2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "P∧Q" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ac8831f6-0b30-5fff-99a5-bdc86ee2c9df" :answer/id #uuid "ac8831f6-0b30-5fff-99a5-bdc86ee2c9df" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "P∨(P∧Q)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d65dc866-fd3f-54f7-a7c4-b6f364caf884" :answer/id #uuid "d65dc866-fd3f-54f7-a7c4-b6f364caf884" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "P∨Q" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-2491e070-37d1-586f-b67e-4103f90ed72e" :question/id #uuid "2491e070-37d1-586f-b67e-4103f90ed72e" :question/math-academy-id "q-177454" :question/problem "$7$ is a composite number **and** odd, **or** $2+6\\ge 10.$\n\nExpress the compound statement above in symbolic form given the following notations:\n\n- $A:7\\text{ is a composite number}$\n\n- $B:7\\text{ is odd}$\n\n- $C:2+6\\ge 10$" :question/worked-solution "The word \"and\" is represented by the symbol \"$∧$\", while the word \"or\" is represented by the symbol \"$∨$\".\n\nNote that this sentence consists of two parts:\n\n- **Part 1:** $7$ is a composite number and odd. This corresponds to\n\n$$\n{{7\\text{ is a composite number}}_{⏟}}_{A}\\,{{\\text{and}}_{⏟}}_{∧}\\,{{7\\text{ is odd}}_{⏟}}_{B},\n$$\n\nthat is, $A∧B.$\n\n- **Part 2:** $2+6\\ge 10.$ This corresponds to $C.$\n\nSo, we can express the sentence as\n\n$$\n{{7\\text{ is a composite number}\\text{ and }\\text{odd}}_{⏟}}_{A\\,∧\\,B},\\,{{\\text{or}}_{⏟}}_{∨}\\,{{2+6\\ge 10}_{⏟}}_{C}\n$$\n\nthat is, $(A∧B)∨C.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-c26531b6-83b5-5a81-9950-dbbf13c02146"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-c26531b6-83b5-5a81-9950-dbbf13c02146" :answer-field/id #uuid "c26531b6-83b5-5a81-9950-dbbf13c02146" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-bb1e4737-f068-5dc9-93f9-8719f933ff8c" :answer-field/choices ["answer-04ead409-7ba2-555d-b147-b597fa497797" "answer-bb1e4737-f068-5dc9-93f9-8719f933ff8c" "answer-8212194c-06a2-5b1f-b2f5-f4a939eb535b" "answer-8aadeebf-6b08-5f6a-a8b4-fccd85c8a92d" "answer-6e776023-0e29-57ef-8885-d844312adff3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-04ead409-7ba2-555d-b147-b597fa497797" :answer/id #uuid "04ead409-7ba2-555d-b147-b597fa497797" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(A∧B)∧C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-bb1e4737-f068-5dc9-93f9-8719f933ff8c" :answer/id #uuid "bb1e4737-f068-5dc9-93f9-8719f933ff8c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(A∧B)∨C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8212194c-06a2-5b1f-b2f5-f4a939eb535b" :answer/id #uuid "8212194c-06a2-5b1f-b2f5-f4a939eb535b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(A∨B)∧C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8aadeebf-6b08-5f6a-a8b4-fccd85c8a92d" :answer/id #uuid "8aadeebf-6b08-5f6a-a8b4-fccd85c8a92d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "A∧(B∨C)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6e776023-0e29-57ef-8885-d844312adff3" :answer/id #uuid "6e776023-0e29-57ef-8885-d844312adff3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "A∨(B∨C)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-6a09aec4-5239-540b-baf9-5ce099cfcf55" :question/id #uuid "6a09aec4-5239-540b-baf9-5ce099cfcf55" :question/math-academy-id "q-178520" :question/problem "$9$ is a perfect square, **or** $3\\ge 4$ **or** $3=5-1.$\n\nExpress the compound statement above in symbolic form given the following notations:\n\n- $P:9\\text{ is a perfect square}$\n\n- $Q:3\\ge 4$\n\n- $R:3=5-1$" :question/worked-solution "The word \"and\" is represented by the symbol \"$∧$\", while the word \"or\" is represented by the symbol \"$∨$\".\n\nNote that this sentence consists of two parts:\n\n- **Part 1:** $9$ is a perfect square. This corresponds to $P.$\n\n- **Part 2:** $3\\ge 4$ or $3=5-1.$ This corresponds to\n\n$$\n{{3\\ge 4}_{⏟}}_{Q}\\,{{\\text{or}}_{⏟}}_{∨}\\,{{3=5-1}_{⏟}}_{R},\n$$\n\nthat is, $Q∨R.$\n\nSo, we can express the sentence as\n\n$$\n{{9\\text{ is a perfect square}}_{⏟}}_{P}\\,{{\\text{or}}_{⏟}}_{∨}\\,{{3\\ge 4\\text{ or }3=5-1}_{⏟}}_{Q\\,∨\\,R},\n$$\n\nthat is, $P∨(Q∨R).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-99a22f08-f710-5288-add1-9afdd22d06f4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-99a22f08-f710-5288-add1-9afdd22d06f4" :answer-field/id #uuid "99a22f08-f710-5288-add1-9afdd22d06f4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-d5e0c017-0650-5764-b19c-c2f60dd1e1d1" :answer-field/choices ["answer-fa14aaed-5c59-5d07-b8f0-fe4765c03035" "answer-df90fb44-f536-52ae-af21-87646c000413" "answer-d5e0c017-0650-5764-b19c-c2f60dd1e1d1" "answer-fcd84110-304d-56fc-9282-893719df54f7" "answer-74a9345e-0af6-509c-8b78-a9538e02cac1"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-fa14aaed-5c59-5d07-b8f0-fe4765c03035" :answer/id #uuid "fa14aaed-5c59-5d07-b8f0-fe4765c03035" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "P∧(Q∧R)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-df90fb44-f536-52ae-af21-87646c000413" :answer/id #uuid "df90fb44-f536-52ae-af21-87646c000413" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "P∨(Q∧R)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d5e0c017-0650-5764-b19c-c2f60dd1e1d1" :answer/id #uuid "d5e0c017-0650-5764-b19c-c2f60dd1e1d1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "P∨(Q∨R)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-fcd84110-304d-56fc-9282-893719df54f7" :answer/id #uuid "fcd84110-304d-56fc-9282-893719df54f7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "R∧(P∨Q)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-74a9345e-0af6-509c-8b78-a9538e02cac1" :answer/id #uuid "74a9345e-0af6-509c-8b78-a9538e02cac1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "R∨(P∧R)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-7d328347-cdbe-5da0-b048-5a26fc979b28" :question/id #uuid "7d328347-cdbe-5da0-b048-5a26fc979b28" :question/math-academy-id "q-177717" :question/problem "$6|10$ **and** $6|18,$ **or** $11$ is prime **and** odd.\n\nExpress the compound statement above in symbolic form given the following notations:\n\n- $M:6|10$\n\n- $P:6|18$\n\n- $N:11\\text{ is prime}$\n\n- $Q:11\\text{ is odd}$" :question/worked-solution "The word \"and\" is represented by the symbol \"$∧$\", while the word \"or\" is represented by the symbol \"$∨$\".\n\nNote that this sentence consists of two parts:\n\n- **Part 1:** $6|10$ and $6|18.$ This corresponds to\n\n$$\n{{6|10}_{⏟}}_{M}\\,{{\\text{and}}_{⏟}}_{∧}\\,{{6|18}_{⏟}}_{P}\n$$\n\nthat is, $M∧P.$\n\n- **Part 2:** $11$ is prime and odd. This corresponds to\n\n$$\n{{11\\text{ is prime}}_{⏟}}_{N}\\,{{\\text{and}}_{⏟}}_{∧}\\,{{11\\text{ is odd }}_{⏟}}_{Q},\n$$\n\nthat is, $N∧Q.$\n\nSo, we can express the sentence as\n\n$$\n{{6|10\\text{ and }6|18}_{⏟}}_{M\\,∧\\,P}\\,{{\\text{or}}_{⏟}}_{∨}\\,{{11\\text{ is prime }\\text{and}\\text{ odd }}_{⏟}}_{N\\,∧\\,Q},\n$$\n\nthat is, $(M∧P)∨(N∧Q).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-ae713bc7-7c15-5579-a80d-6099f958e0e5"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-ae713bc7-7c15-5579-a80d-6099f958e0e5" :answer-field/id #uuid "ae713bc7-7c15-5579-a80d-6099f958e0e5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-08226b09-094d-55bc-a500-13e7bd894d3f" :answer-field/choices ["answer-d2f3e577-3286-59cc-928d-270004a2410d" "answer-cdd60e3e-cf9b-5874-8cb9-65b6ab83f9ad" "answer-08226b09-094d-55bc-a500-13e7bd894d3f" "answer-62d1f44f-6042-5734-9027-0993b4819b69" "answer-68da953e-294d-510b-94be-5d9e6008ed59"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d2f3e577-3286-59cc-928d-270004a2410d" :answer/id #uuid "d2f3e577-3286-59cc-928d-270004a2410d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(M∧N)∧(P∧Q)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-cdd60e3e-cf9b-5874-8cb9-65b6ab83f9ad" :answer/id #uuid "cdd60e3e-cf9b-5874-8cb9-65b6ab83f9ad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(M∧P)∧(N∧Q)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-08226b09-094d-55bc-a500-13e7bd894d3f" :answer/id #uuid "08226b09-094d-55bc-a500-13e7bd894d3f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(M∧P)∨(N∧Q)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-62d1f44f-6042-5734-9027-0993b4819b69" :answer/id #uuid "62d1f44f-6042-5734-9027-0993b4819b69" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(M∨P)∨(N∧Q)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-68da953e-294d-510b-94be-5d9e6008ed59" :answer/id #uuid "68da953e-294d-510b-94be-5d9e6008ed59" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(M∨P)∨(N∨Q)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-02eac488-c624-58c9-8e5f-2f3e12e226ab" :question/id #uuid "02eac488-c624-58c9-8e5f-2f3e12e226ab" :question/math-academy-id "q-178524" :question/problem "$6\\le {3}^{2}$ **and** $6$ is even, **and** $13$ is a prime number.\n\nExpress the compound statement above in symbolic form given the following notations:\n\n- $P:6\\le {3}^{2}$\n\n- $Q:6\\text{ is even}$\n\n- $R:13\\text{ is a prime number}$" :question/worked-solution "The word \"and\" is represented by the symbol \"$∧$\", while the word \"or\" is represented by the symbol \"$∨$\".\n\nNote that this sentence consists of two parts:\n\n- **Part 1:** $6\\le {3}^{2}$ and $6$ is even. This corresponds to\n\n$$\n{{6\\le {3}^{2}}_{⏟}}_{P}\\,{{\\text{and}}_{⏟}}_{∧}\\,{{6\\text{ is even}}_{⏟}}_{Q},\n$$\n\nthat is, $P∧Q.$\n\n- **Part 2:** $13$ is a prime number. This corresponds to $R.$\n\nSo, we can express the sentence as\n\n$$\n{{6\\le {3}^{2}\\text{ and }6\\text{ is even }}_{⏟}}_{P\\,∧\\,Q},\\,{{\\text{and}}_{⏟}}_{∧}\\,{{13\\text{ is a prime number}}_{⏟}}_{R}\n$$\n\nthat is, $(P∧Q)∧R.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-5e4e5ae8-a2a5-5b36-a2dc-8b979138fc73"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-5e4e5ae8-a2a5-5b36-a2dc-8b979138fc73" :answer-field/id #uuid "5e4e5ae8-a2a5-5b36-a2dc-8b979138fc73" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-a5d7f2f3-23a8-5dc8-a56c-57b04c083e5b" :answer-field/choices ["answer-a5d7f2f3-23a8-5dc8-a56c-57b04c083e5b" "answer-8a379917-531a-54d8-af3e-0292be053dd3" "answer-d75f9393-172b-5f63-857d-7b40f1ba5376" "answer-2cb8259e-2609-557c-a939-ddc327a5eee5" "answer-5c299c17-f506-596c-90eb-cd4f3d6b42a7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a5d7f2f3-23a8-5dc8-a56c-57b04c083e5b" :answer/id #uuid "a5d7f2f3-23a8-5dc8-a56c-57b04c083e5b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(P∧Q)∧R" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8a379917-531a-54d8-af3e-0292be053dd3" :answer/id #uuid "8a379917-531a-54d8-af3e-0292be053dd3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(P∧Q)∨R" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d75f9393-172b-5f63-857d-7b40f1ba5376" :answer/id #uuid "d75f9393-172b-5f63-857d-7b40f1ba5376" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(P∨Q)∨R" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2cb8259e-2609-557c-a939-ddc327a5eee5" :answer/id #uuid "2cb8259e-2609-557c-a939-ddc327a5eee5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(P∨R)∧Q" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5c299c17-f506-596c-90eb-cd4f3d6b42a7" :answer/id #uuid "5c299c17-f506-596c-90eb-cd4f3d6b42a7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(R∧P)∨Q" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-717ad532-4709-5a63-b627-09752527f241" :question/id #uuid "717ad532-4709-5a63-b627-09752527f241" :question/math-academy-id "q-177457" :question/problem "$4$ is even **or** ${4}^{2}=12$, **and** $-2$ is an integer number.\n\nExpress the compound statement above in symbolic form given the following notations:\n\n- $M:4\\text{ is even}$\n\n- $N:{4}^{2}=12$\n\n- $P:-2\\text{ is an integer number}$" :question/worked-solution "The word \"and\" is represented by the symbol \"$∧$\", while the word \"or\" is represented by the symbol \"$∨$\".\n\nNote that this sentence consists of two parts:\n\n- **Part 1:** $4$ is even or ${4}^{2}=12.$ This corresponds to\n\n$$\n{{4\\text{ is even }}_{⏟}}_{M}\\,{{\\text{or}}_{⏟}}_{∨}\\,{{{4}^{2}=12}_{⏟}}_{N},\n$$\n\nthat is, $M∨N.$\n\n- **Part 2:** $-2$ is an integer number. This corresponds to $P.$\n\nSo, we can express the sentence as\n\n$$\n{{4\\text{ is even}\\text{ or }{4}^{2}=12}_{⏟}}_{M\\,∨\\,N},\\,{{\\text{and}}_{⏟}}_{∧}\\,{{-2\\text{ is an integer number}}_{⏟}}_{P}\n$$\n\nthat is, $(M∨N)∧P.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-3e7284d0-752d-528a-b20a-055a37d2c544"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-3e7284d0-752d-528a-b20a-055a37d2c544" :answer-field/id #uuid "3e7284d0-752d-528a-b20a-055a37d2c544" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-8d513d5e-04ef-5ac2-8463-b15a460491d0" :answer-field/choices ["answer-0476cbd2-78dc-5e1a-9e60-a8bbb1d9dfd6" "answer-8d513d5e-04ef-5ac2-8463-b15a460491d0" "answer-8ed61285-624c-56ae-a424-83a7b63683eb" "answer-88b17ea2-775b-5a6a-bd44-82b302f7402b" "answer-032dbb2a-5dc1-5e48-9134-272eda68f2b5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0476cbd2-78dc-5e1a-9e60-a8bbb1d9dfd6" :answer/id #uuid "0476cbd2-78dc-5e1a-9e60-a8bbb1d9dfd6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(M∧N)∨P" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8d513d5e-04ef-5ac2-8463-b15a460491d0" :answer/id #uuid "8d513d5e-04ef-5ac2-8463-b15a460491d0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(M∨N)∧P" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8ed61285-624c-56ae-a424-83a7b63683eb" :answer/id #uuid "8ed61285-624c-56ae-a424-83a7b63683eb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(M∨N)∨P" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-88b17ea2-775b-5a6a-bd44-82b302f7402b" :answer/id #uuid "88b17ea2-775b-5a6a-bd44-82b302f7402b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "M∧(N∧P)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-032dbb2a-5dc1-5e48-9134-272eda68f2b5" :answer/id #uuid "032dbb2a-5dc1-5e48-9134-272eda68f2b5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "M∨(N∧P)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-e6fd19f6-d3a7-5978-9314-7283447a9c4c" :question/id #uuid "e6fd19f6-d3a7-5978-9314-7283447a9c4c" :question/math-academy-id "q-175916" :question/problem "$$\n{{0.33\\text{ is rational}}_{⏟}}_{A}\\,{{\\text{and}}_{⏟}}_{∧}\\,{{3+1=2+2}_{⏟}}_{B}\n$$\n\nFor the compound statement above, we have that\n\n$\\,$ $A$ is {{field-1}},\n$\\,$ $B$ is {{field-2}},\n$\\,$ $A∧B$ is {{field-3}}." :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the following facts about the \"and\" $(∧)$ and \"or\" $(∨)$ logical connectives:\n\n- The statement $A∧B$ is true if *both* $A$ and $B$ are true.\n\n- The statement $A∨B$ is true if either $A$ is true, or $B$ is true, or *both* $A$ and $B$ are true.\n\nIn our case, $A$ is true, and $B$ is true. Therefore, the result is true:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{{0.33\\text{ is rational}}_{⏟}}_{A}\\,{{\\text{and}}_{⏟}}_{∧}\\,{{3+1=2+2}_{⏟}}_{B} & \\,\\,≡\\,\\text{true}∧\\text{true}≡\\text{true}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-72f7a99b-3183-507b-ae1f-1ba5d0546e36" "answer-field-f8e5de21-b0a8-5afd-8c47-53a5e9e9ab98" "answer-field-ff601f0c-4e57-5018-96f0-7310734b6270"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "ans